      "id": "HOM-01",
      "title": "Torsion in an integral lattice presentation",
      "chapter": "inputs",
      "anchor": "inputs-degree-two-determinant",
      "statement": "If the rank r of the ambient free abelian group is at most A and each integral relation has ℓ¹ norm at most b, the cokernel has finite torsion of order at most b^A.",
      "hypotheses": "Finite rank r, arbitrary set of relations in ℤ^r, integer b≥1. The quotient may have a free part. The short vectors can be completed over ℚ, irrespective of independence over ℤ of the entire relation set.",
