      "correspondence": "Bound each determinant by the product of row sums via absolute values of the permutation expansion, followed by summation over all row choices. Complete a maximal independent set of relations with unit vectors, and compare the torsion classes to the resulting finite-index quotient via chosen lifts. The argument uses integral coordinates in that completed sublattice and rational independence of the added directions.",
